  "notes": "首次连接更稳，测速更宽容。\n\n- 首次连接前先准备好服务规则，避免刚连上时部分服务走错线路。\n- 自动选线测速的超时不足 5 秒时按 5 秒计算，减少误判节点不可用。\n- 更新内置代理核心，修正统一延迟测速的二次响应日志。\n- 加强更新下载和 DNS 相关的稳定性测试。\n",
  "notesEn": "Steadier first connections and fairer latency tests.\n\n- Prepare service rules before the first connection so services route correctly right away.\n- Raise automatic-group latency test timeouts below 5 seconds to 5 seconds, reducing false unavailable nodes.\n- Update the bundled proxy core to fix second-response logging in unified-delay tests.\n- Strengthen stability tests for update downloads and DNS handling.\n",
